{"unit_id":"huhaodong__dsh-auto-driving#card-zh","repo":"huhaodong/dsh-auto-driving","commit":"7df38571eda5a8404ccadf2d02d3fd41b229d0e4","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-fallback 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的模型恢复与自动驾驶插件。它在 LLM 请求失败时按已选供应商和模型候选继续尝试，并为暂时性错误提供重试与看门狗恢复。设置页可配置供应商分组、重试和全自动模式；对话输入栏提供当前会话开关。全自动模式可自动回答权限、确认和方案审批，并记录工作区审计。适合希望让 DSH 会话在模型故障或等待审批时继续运行的用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1242","lib/index.js:2100","lib/client.js:2740"]}
{"unit_id":"huhaodong__dsh-auto-driving#card-en","repo":"huhaodong/dsh-auto-driving","commit":"7df38571eda5a8404ccadf2d02d3fd41b229d0e4","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-model-fallback helps DSH recover from model failures. It retries configured provider candidates and watches for stalled requests. Its web client adds provider and retry settings plus per-conversation controls. Full-auto mode answers approval requests and records an audit in the workspace.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1242","lib/index.js:2100","lib/client.js:2740"]}
