{"unit_id":"huhaodong__dsh-auto-driving#feature-provider-fallback","repo":"huhaodong/dsh-auto-driving","commit":"7df38571eda5a8404ccadf2d02d3fd41b229d0e4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-fallback 的功能「provider-fallback」：模型请求在没有产生内容前失败时，按已选供应商和模型候选继续尝试；首个成功候选接续当前请求。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1242"]}
{"unit_id":"huhaodong__dsh-auto-driving#feature-retry-watchdog","repo":"huhaodong/dsh-auto-driving","commit":"7df38571eda5a8404ccadf2d02d3fd41b229d0e4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-fallback 的功能「retry-watchdog」：暂时性请求失败可按设置重试；看门狗检测长时间无输出后重发请求，客户端设置页提供相关参数。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1242","lib/client.js:201"]}
{"unit_id":"huhaodong__dsh-auto-driving#feature-conversation-controls","repo":"huhaodong/dsh-auto-driving","commit":"7df38571eda5a8404ccadf2d02d3fd41b229d0e4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-fallback 的功能「conversation-controls」：输入栏胶囊可分别切换当前对话的模型回退与全自动模式，子会话可继承所属对话状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:2740","lib/index.js:1917"]}
{"unit_id":"huhaodong__dsh-auto-driving#feature-approval-autopilot","repo":"huhaodong/dsh-auto-driving","commit":"7df38571eda5a8404ccadf2d02d3fd41b229d0e4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-fallback 的功能「approval-autopilot」：启用全自动模式后，权限请求、确认问题和方案评审可按默认选择自动应答，并追加工作区审计记录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:2100","lib/index.js:415"]}
{"unit_id":"huhaodong__dsh-auto-driving#caveat-audit","repo":"huhaodong/dsh-auto-driving","commit":"7df38571eda5a8404ccadf2d02d3fd41b229d0e4","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-fallback 的全自动模式会自动应答权限、确认和方案评审；每次决策可写入工作区根目录的 AUTO-MODE.md。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:2100","lib/index.js:415"]}
